00:09:31.577 --> 00:09:34.380
&gt;&gt; I GET THIS.

00:09:32.311 --> 00:09:35.648
&gt;&gt; THAT IS NOT HONEST.

00:09:34.513 --> 00:09:37.216
IT'S AGAINST THE LAW.

00:09:35.781 --> 00:09:37.983
THAT'S WHAT HE IS ASKING

00:09:37.349 --> 00:09:39.518
SESSIONS TO LOOK AT.

00:09:38.117 --> 00:09:43.322
&gt;&gt; ONE THING I COULD NOT STAND

00:09:39.652 --> 00:09:44.056
IN WASHINGTON WHEN I WORKED ON

00:09:43.455 --> 00:09:44.823
CAPITAL ONE AND AT THE JUSTICE

00:09:44.189 --> 00:09:48.594
DEPARTMENT AND THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:09:44.957 --> 00:09:50.562
HOW PEOPLE ON BOTH SIDES USE

00:09:48.727 --> 00:09:50.929
LETTERS TO SOMEBODY ELSE TO GET

00:09:50.696 --> 00:09:53.399
ATTENTION.

00:09:51.063 --> 00:09:55.000
IT'S SO ANNOYING.

00:09:53.532 --> 00:09:56.402
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT TRUMP BYPASSES THE

00:09:55.134 --> 00:09:56.702
WHOLE PROCESS AND JUST SENDS A

00:09:56.535 --> 00:09:57.369
TWEET.

00:09:56.835 --> 00:10:00.039
&gt;&gt; I DISAGREE.

00:09:57.503 --> 00:10:01.473
I THINK IT'S NICE TO BRING BACK

00:10:00.172 --> 00:10:03.909
THE LETTER.

00:10:01.607 --> 00:10:07.813
I LOVE HAND WRITING.

00:10:04.043 --> 00:10:13.919
FANS WRITE TO ME ABOUT THE SHOW.

00:10:07.946 --> 00:10:15.955
I READ EVERY PIECE OF MAIL.

00:10:14.053 --> 00:10:16.288
OLDER PEOPLE HAVE BETTER HAND

00:10:16.088 --> 00:10:18.657
WRITING.

00:10:16.422 --> 00:10:19.291
YOUNG PEOPLE LOOK AT A PEN AND

00:10:18.791 --> 00:10:22.127
GET NERVOUS.

00:10:19.425 --> 00:10:24.563
&gt;&gt; DO YOU READ THE FAN MAIL FROM

00:10:22.261 --> 00:10:26.899
PEOPLE CUTTING OUT LETTERS IN

00:10:24.697 --> 00:10:29.101
THE ENVELOPE.

00:10:27.032 --> 00:10:35.207
&gt;&gt; I LIKE WHEN THEY WRITE

00:10:29.234 --> 00:10:36.275
OUTSIDE ON THE ENVELOPE.

00:10:35.341 --> 00:10:39.745
&gt;&gt; THAT'S LIKE JAIL MAIL.

00:10:36.408 --> 00:10:46.252
&gt;&gt; YOU GET A LOT OF JAIL MALE.

